## Summary of the Absolute Apex Flaws

| Vulnerability | Where it Hides | Why it is Virtually Invisible |
|---|---|---|
| ID Recycling | Probability Space | Only happens under massive transaction volumes over time. |
| Parameter Pollution | Parser Mismatches | Both the validator and processor are working perfectly; they just disagree on reading order. |
| Implicit Truth | Default else Blocks | The code looks clean, but errors out into a "success" state rather than a closed state. |

